 "name_en": "Free Goods Processing (BKA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Free Goods Processing (BKA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process starts with the creation of a customer standard sales order using a material for which a free goods condition record is maintained. Depending on the ordered quantities, customers receive free goods.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">After the completion of picking, the shipping specialist relieves the inventory. This inventory relief is the actual recording of the physical quantity that is being shipped to the customer.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With the goods issue posting revenue is recognized and cost of goods sold is recorded in Financial Accounting.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Once goods are delivered, you can invoice the delivery.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">For details on bundling functionalities for IFRS 15, see note 2524569.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print order confirmation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute picking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform availability check upon order entry</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine shipping point automatically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine inclusive free goods automatically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a billing document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make postings to FI and CO</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>赠品处理 (BKA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该流程首先使用维护赠品条件记录的物料，创建客户标准销售订单。根据订购数量，客户会收到赠品。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">完成拣配后，装运专员将释放库存。此库存减免 是实际记录装运到客户的实际数量。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过发货过账，在财务会计中确认收入并记录销货成本。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">交货后，您可以为交货开发票。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">有关 IFRS 15 捆绑功能的详细信息，请参阅注释 2524569。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印订单确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行拣配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6b68a4d40f1141fb91a286ad2c99ca66__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在订单输入时执行可用性检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动确定装运点</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动确定全包赠品</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账到 FI 和 CO</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
